<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ERPM says mine restructuring talks continue.</title>
<headline>ERPM says mine restructuring talks continue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>East Rand Proprietary Mines Ltd said on Thursday that negotiations regarding the possible restructuring of the mine had not yet produced constructive results.</p>
<p>ERPM advised shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in their shares until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>An earlier cautionary announcement was made on May 23.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
